[{:db/id 17592186125014 :question/problem "The level curves of the function $f(x,y)={x}^{3}y-{y}^{2}x$ are given by $f(x,y)=c.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $c=-1$ gives a line\n\nII. $c=0$ gives a parabola and the axes $x=0$ and $y=0$\n\nIII. $c=1$ gives two lines" :question/worked-solution "Setting $f(x,y)=c$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3}y-{y}^{2}x & =c \\\\ xy({x}^{2}-y) & =c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- If $c=\\pm 1$ then the level curves are $xy({x}^{2}-y)=\\pm 1,$ which are not lines.\n\n- If $c=0$ then the level curves are $xy({x}^{2}-y)=0,$ which consists of the axes $x=0$ and $y=0$, and the parabola $y={x}^{2}.$\n\nSo, only statement II is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186122684 :answer-field/correct 17592186122687 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186338937 :question/problem "The level curves of the function $f(x,y)=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}}$ are given by $f(x,y)=c.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $c=1$ gives a line\n\nII. $c=2$ gives a hyperbola\n\nIII. $c=0$ gives two lines" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124476 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-ca25fed3-89e3-5069-b0f1-d69395195a30"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-ca25fed3-89e3-5069-b0f1-d69395195a30" :question/id #uuid "ca25fed3-89e3-5069-b0f1-d69395195a30" :question/math-academy-id "q-129115" :question/problem "Which of the following represents the level curves of $f(x,y)=2x+y?$" :question/worked-solution "The level curves for the function $f(x,y)$ are given by the equations \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=c.\n$$\n\nNotice that the range of $f(x,y)$ is $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ So, we will consider level curves for any value of $c.$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =c \\\\ 2x+y & =c \\\\ y & =-2x+c.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation above gives us a family of lines with slope of $-2.$ Therefore, the correct graph is as follows:\n\n![](images/ff/ff1117065d7475786dd6c45f71f14d78b32cb3273123ced1adf5a67b750dacdd.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6a04a0ad-4057-596b-b2f3-8b4c7bc755f2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6a04a0ad-4057-596b-b2f3-8b4c7bc755f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a04a0ad-4057-596b-b2f3-8b4c7bc755f2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ed3cc711-dc0b-5b9e-a281-a519fe0fd7e8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b23cb473-4c8b-55bf-98c3-c301ef278556" "answer-5cac3057-4676-5ed3-95e8-e4e063eba65b" "answer-61cd2c81-8156-5dbe-b41f-65c5a923eb06" "answer-928d4148-96cc-555a-8460-275af511b8a3" "answer-ed3cc711-dc0b-5b9e-a281-a519fe0fd7e8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b23cb473-4c8b-55bf-98c3-c301ef278556" :answer/id #uuid "b23cb473-4c8b-55bf-98c3-c301ef278556" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/3d/3d7cde978fe7dd74efe8deb0b7b6e507c7ddf549bb45f1eeda81ee82a8b4a002.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5cac3057-4676-5ed3-95e8-e4e063eba65b" :answer/id #uuid "5cac3057-4676-5ed3-95e8-e4e063eba65b" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/ae/ae78f21487e5883b278f0b62a92b2b44ffe8e83e9bd942cf6c94ed4c46d18c67.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-61cd2c81-8156-5dbe-b41f-65c5a923eb06" :answer/id #uuid "61cd2c81-8156-5dbe-b41f-65c5a923eb06" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/e4/e405503abc7c773cde77a3631e3e39ed1693e3aac958731a9a8ae52e618b03fa.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-928d4148-96cc-555a-8460-275af511b8a3" :answer/id #uuid "928d4148-96cc-555a-8460-275af511b8a3" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/f9/f9f6a496ebabedfb6f73db014080b64a3830214b337bd61c4ac4f4d996a93bd5.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ed3cc711-dc0b-5b9e-a281-a519fe0fd7e8" :answer/id #uuid "ed3cc711-dc0b-5b9e-a281-a519fe0f